<title>NETHERLANDS: ING Barings rates PolyGram Buy.</title>
<headline>ING Barings rates PolyGram Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-08-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Aug 22 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    PolyGram	  Music/film    100.40  ING Barings</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy - (note focuses on film business) - Earnings breakdown of music market leader PolyGram reveals terrific value. Twelve-month price target of 118 guilders, which translates into expected outperformance od 12.5 percent to the market. Music business is priced at 17 percent discount to EMI. Film business, started from scratch in 1991, still loss-making but worth at least Dfl 1.5 bln, PolyGram shares should be valued on basis of this. Film unit could become great asset.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	4.12		  24.4    0.95</p>
<p>    1996		   4.64     4.65     21.6    1.00</p>
<p>    1997		   5.36     5.35     18.7    1.15</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
